    "question": {
      ":question/id": "85f85abd-13e2-56f3-a118-3275cd35edd0",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices has a rank of $4?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, notice that a matrix of rank $4$ must have at least $4$ columns and at least $4$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the following matrices:\n\n- $A$ since it has only $2$ rows.\n\n- $B$ since it has only $3$  rows.\n\n- $D$ since it has only $3$ columns.\n\nAlso, the matrix must have $4$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $C$ has exactly $4$ pivot columns, while the matrix $E$ has only $3$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(C)=4$ and $\\text{rank}(E)=3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the matrix $C.$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "19dde81c-02b2-554c-be7c-780c438d9e99",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "ece84325-948d-5e3e-a28f-0744c6d65209",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "60729a58-5391-576e-ba86-22fe8b8b5c64",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "B=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c76db9a9-4ee4-5a1f-8643-ce9cf14cc0d0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "E=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "d26b93c6-b2ff-594e-a19f-2c9c7390ab40",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "669f71a3-5996-50f6-9dd8-9b3214f34160",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "C=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 4 & 2 & 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
